{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D6Egho5f2V9JjhHndNFMH5","type":"tool_result","content":"decompose status |MUT: none | Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\ndecompose review |MUT: Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology. | Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\ndecompose impact |MUT: none | Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\ndecompose compile |MUT: Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves. | Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\nmesh status |MUT: uninitialized status is read-only; existing runtime inspection may restart its daemon | Usage: taskspec mesh status [<run-or-attempt>]\nmesh explain |MUT: may initialize a missing daemon and write Git metadata; does not seal or accept tasks | Usage: taskspec mesh explain --task <id> [--adapter <name>] [--model <id>]\nmesh frontier |MUT: may initialize a missing daemon and write Git metadata; does not seal or accept tasks | Usage: taskspec mesh frontier \ngraph |MUT: none; TaskGraphView/v1 is derived from Markdown and Git | Usage: taskspec graph [--task <id>] [--check] [--mermaid] [--json] | taskspec graph --initiative <id> --view tasks|capabilities\nstatus |MUT: none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command | Usage: taskspec status <task-id-or-path> [--json] | taskspec status --initiative <id>\nevidence |MUT: run writes an explicit evidence directory; validate/plan are read-only | Usage: taskspec evidence validate|plan|run <EngineMatrix.json> ...\nreceipt |MUT: creator/sign commands write explicit receipt paths; validate is read-only | Usage: taskspec receipt validate|sign|engine|environment|evaluation|graded|human ...\nholdout |MUT: seal/run may write descriptor or receipt; verify is read-only | Usage: taskspec holdout seal|verify|run ...\neval-audit |MUT: uses temporary git worktrees; optional report path | Usage: ta