{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf59fsFL2AQno5p7Sy42N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read-only inspection of canonical records for initiative `managed` (intent `DI-RATE-LIMIT`). No execution, no stamping — only `status`, `graph --view capabilities`, `decompose status` (all declared `mutation: none`) plus direct file reads.\n\n## Accepted\n\n**`T-20260914-chat-output` — \"Complete the output artifact\"** (1/1 tasks accepted)\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Acceptance record | `.taskspec/acceptance/T-20260914-chat-output/05d5c3d6-…json`, `AcceptanceRecord/v1` |\n| Outcome | `ACCEPTED_TIER_1`, accepted by `luanmorenomaciel` at 2026-09-15T11:30:16Z |\n| Subject revision | `sha256:f05fe427…` on base commit `3082bf60` |\n| Gates | preflight, authorization, evaluation, evidence — all `pass` |\n| Evals | `eval_1`, `eval_2`, `eval_3`, `_exit_check` all `pass` (round 1, `.taskspec/mesh/artifacts/…round-1.evals.json`) |\n| Attempt | `05d5c3d6-…`, terminal outcome `success`, mesh state `integrated`, fencing token 1 |\n\nThat is acceptance of one leaf outcome: `a.txt` holds the accepted completion value and `b.txt` stays empty.\n\n## Unproven\n\n**Capability `LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID`** (seam `SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT`, lane `LANE-POLICY-CONTRACT`) — state `unproven`.\n\n- `proof_tasks: []`, gap reported by the capability view: **integration proof task missing**.\n- The leg's declared observable state (\"the completion artifact contains its accepted value\") and its proof (\"exact output and untouched sibling checks pass\") have no task that owns that proof. The accepted child task is listed under `tasks`, not `proof_tasks` — its passing evals do not discharge the leg.\n- `proof_gaps: [\"LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID\"]`; the steel thread consists of this single leg, so the initiative has **zero proven capabilities**.\n\n## Evidence caveats worth carrying\n\n- `receipts: []` on the acceptance record; the evidence gate passed on the basis \"format v3 or earlier: v4 policy receipts are not required.\" So there is no engine/environment receipt backing beyond the Tier-1 envelope.\n- Round metadata records `execution_identity.source: unreported_harness_default` (provider and model `null`), `evaluation_environment: sanitized_host`, empty `sandbox_evidence`.\n- Acceptance here is task acceptance only — not service health, not release authorization. Provider-owned metering and production storage/deployment remain explicitly out of scope in the intent.\n\n## Smallest next action\n\nAuthor an integration proof task for `LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID` in the managed recipe (it would own the leg's independent proof, then be sealed and run through the Mesh route). Nothing in the current state authorizes that; `taskspec guide acceptance` is the CLI's own suggested next step if you want the canonical procedure text first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2332,"cache_read_input_tokens":24871,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2332},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e19de622-aac2-4e7a-86d5-c7c992745cf9","uuid":"c9f00bd8-5da3-4c6b-ad22-16c02c3a9497","timestamp":"2026-09-15T11:31:49.572Z","request_id":"req_011Cf59frhajexdkbeEriCze"}
